        "config": {
          "version": 1,
          "agentRef": "calling-agent",
          "prompt": "You are the original working Agent in your existing conversation. Read BOTH full reviews from inputs, inspect the current source, fact-check every blocker and deduplicate overlapping findings. Explain dismissed findings with evidence. Fix only confirmed problems while preserving unrelated changes and run the relevant checks. Do not start additional reviewers, recursively invoke this Workflow, or change its graph. Submit explicit completion with outcome, summary and data matching resultSchema using workflow caller-done for this exact Run, attempt and request. At most two fixes are allowed. Every fix is followed by a fresh independent review; after the second fix the final review may report unresolved blockers, which require user judgment rather than another fix.",
